  never had Docker Desktop.

Docker Buildx CLI plugin for Windows
  version  0.36.1
  licence  Apache-2.0
  source   https://github.com/docker/buildx/releases/download/v0.36.1/buildx-v0.36.1.windows-amd64.exe
  The BuildKit builder, placed beside Compose. Without it the CLI falls back to the
  legacy builder, which cannot parse a cache mount, a heredoc or a secret mount, so a
  Dockerfile that builds anywhere else fails here.

